 0 0 0 0 1 0 0 1   H H L H L Z Z Z /*04  IORC */
 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 1   H H L H L Z Z Z /*05  IORC */
 0 1 0 0 1 1 0 1   H H H L L Z Z Z /*06  IOWC */
 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 1   L H H H L Z Z Z /*07  CODE MRDC */
